{"id": "99210116", "name": "צפיפות משותפת c(x²+xy/k) על מלבן – הקבוע, הצפיפות השולית ו-P(X>Y)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>לזוג המשתנים המקריים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((X,Y)\\)</span> צפיפות משותפת<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f(x,y)=\\begin{cases}c\\left({{CT:0}}\\right), & 0\\lt x\\lt 1,\\ 0\\lt y\\lt {{CT:1}}\\\\ 0, & \\text{otherwise}\\end{cases} \\]</p>כאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(c\\)</span> קבוע.</p><p style=\"margin-top:12px\">א. מצאו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(c\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p style=\"margin-top:12px\">ב. מצאו את הצפיפות השולית <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f_X(x)\\)</span> עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(0\\lt x\\lt 1\\)</span> (ביטוי ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span>).</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div><p style=\"margin-top:12px\">ג. חשבו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{P}(X>Y)\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> נרמול – אינטגרל כפול על המלבן; צפיפות שולית – אינטגרל לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y\\)</span>; <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{P}(X>Y)\\)</span> – אינטגרל כפול על המשולש <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(0\\lt y\\lt x\\lt 1\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — הקבוע</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int_0^1\\int_0^{ {{CT:1}} }\\left({{CT:0}}\\right)dy\\,dx=\\int_0^1\\left({{CT:2}}\\right)dx=\\frac{ {{CT:1}} }{3}+\\frac{ {{CT:3}} }{ {{CT:4}} }={{CT:5}} \\]</p>ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(c={{CT:6}}\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — הצפיפות השולית</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f_X(x)=\\int_0^{ {{CT:1}} }c\\left({{CT:0}}\\right)dy={{CT:7}},\\qquad 0\\lt x\\lt 1 \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — P(X>Y)</b><br>כיוון ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\lt 1\\le {{CT:1}}\\)</span>, התחום <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\{y\\lt x\\}\\)</span> הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(0\\lt y\\lt x\\lt 1\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{P}(X>Y)=c\\int_0^1\\int_0^x\\left({{CT:0}}\\right)dy\\,dx=c\\int_0^1\\left(1+\\frac{1}{ {{CT:8}} }\\right)x^3dx={{CT:6}}\\cdot{{CT:9}}={{CT:10}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]][[feedback:prt2]][[feedback:prt3]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 40, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "cc", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "fx", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "if fx/cc=fx then -1 else fx/cc", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-2-T", "feedback": "<p>שכחתם לכפול בקבוע \\(c\\).</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-2-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "prt3", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv"